{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c0b1b7e-db0e-11ef-8fce-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c0b1b79-db0e-11ef-abe3-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"懷縣","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：慈惠愛親曰孝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：慈惠爱亲曰孝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9487e2d3-db0e-11ef-8261-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"平原郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9487e2da-db0e-11ef-b943-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9487e2db-db0e-11ef-b951-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡國志：平原郡，在雒陽北千三百里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡国志：平原郡，在雒阳北千三百里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"9487e2d9-db0e-11ef-9014-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9487e2d2-db0e-11ef-b80c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"shì","source_anchor_text":"追思良乃貰出子春遷","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":138,"text":"貰","tongjian_id":"6ce21788-9c1f-5d85-96a1-406bd601f1ea"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"懷縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀县","resolved_place_entity_id":889,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9488b5c2-db0e-11ef-947b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，趙孝公良薨。初，懷縣大姓李子春二孫殺人，懷令趙憙窮治其姦，二孫自殺，收繫子春。京師貴戚爲請者數十，憙終不聽。及良病，上臨視之，問所欲言，良曰：「素與李子春厚，今犯罪，懷令趙憙欲殺之，願乞其命。」帝曰：「吏奉法律，不可枉也。更道他所欲。」良無復言。旣薨，上追思良，乃貰出子春。遷憙爲平原太守。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，赵孝公刘良去世。当初，怀县豪门大族李子春的两个孙子杀人，怀县令赵憙彻底追究他们的罪行，两个孙子自杀，李子春被收押入狱。在洛阳的皇亲国戚有数十人为李子春求情，赵憙始终没有答应。等到刘良病重时，光武帝亲自到病榻前探望，问他还想说些什么，刘良说：“我向来与李子春交情深厚，如今他犯了罪，怀县令赵憙要杀他，希望饶他一命。”光武帝说：“官吏奉行法律，法律不可歪曲。你另外说别的愿望吧。”刘良不再说话。刘良去世后，光武帝追念叔父刘良，便赦免释放了李子春。又提升赵憙为平原郡太守。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，赵孝公良薨。初，怀县大姓李子春二孙杀人，怀令赵憙穷治其奸，二孙自杀，收系子春。京师贵戚为请者数十，憙终不听。及良病，上临视之，问所欲言，良曰：「素与李子春厚，今犯罪，怀令赵憙欲杀之，愿乞其命。」帝曰：「吏奉法律，不可枉也。更道他所欲。」良无复言。既薨，上追思良，乃贳出子春。迁憙为平原太守。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3367,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十三 (漢紀三十五) / 世祖光武皇帝中之下 / 十七年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9487e2d2-db0e-11ef-b80c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":41},"tongjian_id":"9487e2d2-db0e-11ef-b80c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"懷縣","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"迥","people_name_jianti_auto":"迥","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"b337196a-db0e-11ef-a260-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隋高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"隋高祖","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"b337196b-db0e-11ef-93dd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汲郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汲郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b337196c-db0e-11ef-bf3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"东魏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b337196d-db0e-11ef-be32-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"義州","place_name_jianti_auto":"义州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b337196e-db0e-11ef-88cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_nam