ties":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：上黨郡，後周置潞州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：上党郡，后周置潞州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":196,"tongjian_id":"b33719f2-db0e-11ef-b701-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鉅鹿","place_name_jianti_auto":"巨鹿","place_note":"河北藁城","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b33719f8-db0e-11ef-a28c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b33719f9-db0e-11ef-90af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄國郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄国郡","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b33719fa-db0e-11ef-b135-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鉅鹿，古郡也，隋爲縣，屬襄國郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"巨鹿，古郡也，隋为县，属襄国郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":221,"tongjian_id":"b33719f7-db0e-11ef-a190-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"恆山郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"恒山郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b33719fc-db0e-11ef-bcc2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b33719fd-db0e-11ef-8f5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"恆州","place_name_jianti_auto":"恒州","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b33719fe-db0e-11ef-8738-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：恆山郡，後周置恆州。恆，戶登翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：恒山郡，后周置恒州。恒，户登翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":226,"tongjian_id":"b33719fb-db0e-11ef-bf0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"滎陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"荥阳郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3371a01-db0e-11ef-ab37-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"浚儀縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"浚仪县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3371a02-db0e-11ef-9a83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"东魏","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b3371a03-db0e-11ef-8cc6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁州","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b3371a04-db0e-11ef-902c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b3371a05-db0e-11ef-a6bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汴州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴州","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b3371a06-db0e-11ef-a2e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：滎陽郡浚儀縣，東魏置梁州，後周改曰汴州。汴，皮變翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：荥阳郡浚仪县，东魏置梁州，后周改曰汴州。汴，皮变翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":237,"tongjian_id":"b3371a00-db0e-11ef-8d03-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"琅邪郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"琅邪郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3371a09-db0e-11ef-987d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"北徐州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b3371a0a-db0e-11ef-9bcc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b3371a0b-db0e-11ef-a46e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沂州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沂州","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b3371a0c-db0e-11ef-b93d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：琅邪郡，舊置北徐州，後周改曰沂州。帥，讀曰率。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：琅邪郡，旧置北徐州，后周改曰沂州。帅，读曰率。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":255,"tongjian_id":"b3371a08-db0e-11ef-9850-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濟陰郡","place_name